</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S9" title="In Priming: Hybrid State Space Models From Pre-trained Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9 </span>Scalable Implementations</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_section">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S9.SS1" title="In 9 Scalable Implementations ‣ Priming: Hybrid State Space Models From Pre-trained Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9.1 </span>Priming Fused Architecture</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S9.SS2" title="In 9 Scalable Implementations ‣ Priming: Hybrid State Space Models From Pre-trained Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9.2 </span>Sequence Parallelism for Long-context Training of Hybrid Models</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
